    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span><span class=\"chip company\">Flipkart</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Customer Support Chat &amp; Agent Routing</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Design the system behind \"Chat with us\": guess why the customer is writing from their recent orders, put them in the right skill queue, match them to a free agent without ever losing the contact, and carry the conversation in real time - the exact question Amazon SDE-2 loops asked in 2026 and Flipkart asked as a \"call manager\".</p>\n      "
